{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object in range, approach and grab it. If detected, scan properties, perform task and move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachTargetObject    /> <Action ID = GrabTargetObject    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetObjectInRange    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanTargetObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
